  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每类武器都有专属连招与距离定位，可近身砸刺也可远程轰击",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Practice and perfect combo attacks for each weapon type to reach your destructive potential. Discover and upgrade different weapons and armor to further enhance your combat effectiveness. Master a variety of weapons or specialize in the one that suits you best. Each weapon type offers its own distinct combat style and benefits. Get in close to smash, slam, pierce, or hang back and blast your foes from a distance.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2015270/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boss以独特招式与机制检验弱点分析和武器精通，胜利战利品用于挑战更强敌人",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Boss fights are not just a test of strength but also a test of skill. Each boss has unique attack patterns and mechanics, requiring careful analysis of their weaknesses and precise mastery of your weapons to tackle Rotwood's toughest foes. Victory grants you unique loot required to face ever-increasing challenges as you progress through the game!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2015270/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "成长核心是练习与熟练度而非随机运气，让每轮技术进步可控",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "While every run offers different powers and abilities, progression is built on skill and mastery rather than randomness. Through practice and proficiency, you’ll learn to take down increasingly formidable foes more effectively with greater efficiency and precision. The challenges ahead may be unpredictable, but your fate is not. While Rotwood has elements of randomness, true mastery comes from skill, adaptability, and precise execution, not luck.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2015270/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
  "opinions": [
    {
      "text": "画面表现很出色。",
      "dimension": "画风",
