          "excerpt": "the game looks amazing",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/raphisane/recommended/2015270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "整体节奏缓慢且无聊。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "鉴赏家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "It felt slow and boring",
          "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/curator/41005226-CATS-GAMING-REVIEWS/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "武器战技复用导致职业差异不足。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "四种职业共用一个战技就很奇怪",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199100801672/recommended/2015270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "攻击后摇无法立即用翻滚取消。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "后摇无法立刻用翻滚打断了",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199100801672/recommended/2015270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "更换流派成本过高，削弱尝试动力。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "更换流派的成本较高，需要重复投入大量时间重新刷取资源",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mYmJesse/recommended/2015270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "缺乏肉鸽玩法的爽快感。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "没有肉鸽的快感",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/929150513/recommended/2015270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "大量神力缺乏实际意义。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "很多“神力”选择，但其中相当一部分缺乏实际意义",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mYmJesse/recommended/2015270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "控制与功能流派不如单纯堆伤害有效。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "控制、功能性、玩法差异，最终都不如直接堆数值输出来得有效",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mYmJesse/recommended/2015270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "后期体验极其枯燥。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "后期巨枯燥",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199058901961/recommended/2015270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "快速战斗与灵敏控制让每场战斗都很满足。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "鉴赏家观点",
      "polarity": "喜欢",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "Fast combat and responsive controls make every fight satisfying.",
